  "description": "The ultimate Pro level complete bike - the Chase Element. With a updated frame design, that uses the same geometry as our Championship winning ACT and RSP Frame., letting you know it's a serious race bike. Our bikes can help you win by giving you an unfair, advantage with some of the most advanced technology for a complete bike in BMX racing. Chase has been pushing the envelope for the past 12 years with our complete bikes and the newest edition of the Element, is the best BMX race bike we have ever offered.\n\nThe Element frame is built up with some of the best parts in BMX, including- IKON Tapered Pro Carbon 20mm Fork, Element Alloy Rims, Tioga Fastr Tires, KMC Chain, Sealed Bearing ISO Cassette hub with 72 points of engagement, 31.8 Handlebars & Stem, Insight PL4 Cranks, Insight Chainring, Grips, and Shimano Hydraulic Rear Brake with 120mm Rotor.\n\nPlease note: Photos are for illustrative purposes only. Real photos will follow later.",
